  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>tolfenamic_acid</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>M01AG02</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Landoni MF et al. 1996</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>calves</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>tolfenamic acid</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>accepted with caveats</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_tolfenamic_acid/TolfenamicAcid_Landoni1996_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>elimination half-life (T1/2 beta)</td><td>2.5</td><td>hours</td><td><small>t1/2β</small></td></tr><tr><td>volume of distribution (Vdarea)</td><td>0.98</td><td>litre kg-1</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>body clearance</td><td>0.3</td><td>litre kg-1 h-1</td><td><small>CLb</small></td></tr></table><h4>About tolfenamic_acid</h4><p>Tolfenamic acid is a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug (a fenamate) used as an analgesic and anti-inflammatory, for example for pain and rheumatic conditions. It is an approved medicine, though not authorised by the European Medicines Agency, and is used only in some countries rather than worldwide.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q59412\">Wikidata Q59412</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.TolfenamicAcid\">TolfenamicAcid</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Landoni MF et al. (1996). Pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics of tolfenamic acid in calves. <i>Research in veterinary science 61(1):26–32</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0034-5288(96)90106-x\">10.1016/s0034-5288(96)90106-x</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/8819190\">8819190</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Landoni_1996: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"),
